{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cYou are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1758079509\" width=308 height=333 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>I WANT YOU TO JOIN THIS EXPEDITION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0  \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5c5b0b86c6f9a052c60ef79636a16ce9.avif?t=1758079509\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.poster.avif?t=1758079509\" width=670 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.webm?t=1758079509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3