\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/4f9981a5af97e09a47a40774abbc559b.poster.avif?t=1758079509\" width=670 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/4f9981a5af97e09a47a40774abbc559b.webm?t=1758079509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/4f9981a5af97e09a47a40774abbc559b.mp4?t=1758079509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything you can find to your disposal, and remember to secure the classified documents to be sent back to base \u2013 the fate of the mission depends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3879330?t=1758079509","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/42731e048cf2a7e5eb8f0af4bab1d7f12b298443/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758079509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/b7140f80f8d12dca343200f3461371a8cec681cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758079509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/b7140f80f8d12dca343200f3461371a8cec681cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758079509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>In Development</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are <strong>Burning Boats Studios</strong>, an independent game development team based in Mexico. We're thrilled to announce <strong>Mindaro</strong>, our ambitious project currently in active development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/aa52b55144891d9765657f8beb573713.avif?t=1758079509\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras_big/aa52b55144891d9765657f8beb573713.avif?t=1758079509 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a small, dedicated team, our passion is to craft an engaging and polished gaming experience that resonates with a wide audience. We believe in creating games that are not only fun to play but also contribute positively to the gaming community we're proud to be a part of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your</strong> <strong>feedback</strong> is invaluable to us. We openly welcome any questions, suggestions, or constructive criticism as we continue to refine Mindaro. Thank you for following our progress; your support means the world. If you haven't already, please consider adding Mindaro to your <strong>wishlist</strong> \u2013 it truly helps us on our journey to launch a game we believe everyone will enjoy.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend the dangerous depths of Mindaro, a 1-6 player co-op action-horror game. Navigate caves, biomes, and industrial ruins while scavenging for survival and uncovering hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cYou are not the first to be sent and may not be the last.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/9724d7ee20d7d27634d216a1e5a02d6c.avif?t=1758079509\" width=308 height=333 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>I WANT YOU TO JOIN THIS EXPEDITION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0  \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5c5b0b86c6f9a052c60ef79636a16ce9.avif?t=1758079509\" width=900 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.poster.avif?t=1758079509\" width=670 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.webm?t=1758079509\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3879330/extras/5d83c2137cc1e7f92952a10b893946fe.mp4?t=1758079509\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out what's on the bottom of this abyss, descending through layers as deep as your courage will allow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0  \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragra